@title: A popup that closes itself hands back to its opener
STEP 1: Sign in through a popup
    NAVIGATE to @SITE@/tabs.html
    CLICK the 'Sign in with a popup' button
    FILL 'User name' field with 'ada'
    CLICK the 'Authorize' button
    VERIFY that 'Signed in as ada' is present
STEP 2: rel=noopener still opens a tab the engine follows
    CLICK the 'Open without opener' link
    VERIFY that 'Manul Plush' is present
DONE.
